SOURCE AND INHERITED TERMS

This dataset consists of questions and answers derived from SUN RGB-D:

    S. Song, S. Lichtenberg, and J. Xiao. "SUN RGB-D: A RGB-D Scene
    Understanding Benchmark Suite." CVPR 2015.

SUN RGB-D is distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0, and that license is inherited
here. This release contains no RGB or depth imagery: every row references a
SUN RGB-D frame by relative path, and users must obtain the imagery from the
original distribution under its own terms. The question text, answers,
canonical vocabulary, splits, and build code in this repository are the
contribution licensed above.

ATTRIBUTION

Please cite both this benchmark and SUN RGB-D. The dataset's own metadata,
including the frozen version identifier to cite, is in manifest.json.

NO WARRANTY

This dataset is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. Known label
defects measured at release time are documented in stats/report.md and in
docs/DATASET_CREATION_PLAN.md; see in particular defect D17 (existence
negatives) and D16 (out-of-frame referents).
